msgstr "Auxiliary variable for reducing the divergence of the magnetic field (the potential of divB cleaning)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "保存する量は運動量 $\\rho\\boldsymbol{v}$ や全エネルギーですが、配列として持つのは速度 $\\boldsymbol{v}$ と単位質量あたりの内部エネルギー $e$ です。 時間積分では、いったん保存量を作って進め、最後に $\\rho$ で割って速度と $e$ に戻します（8 節）。"
msgstr "The conserved quantities are the momentum $\\rho\\boldsymbol{v}$, the total energy, and so on, but the arrays hold the velocity $\\boldsymbol{v}$ and the internal energy per unit mass $e$. In the time integration, we first form the conserved quantities and advance them, and at the end divide by $\\rho$ to recover the velocity and $e$ (Section 8)."

msgid "1.2 基礎方程式"
msgstr "1.2 Basic equations"

msgid "MISO は理想 MHD 方程式を、Gauss 単位系（磁場の項に $1/4\\pi$ が付く形）で解きます。 $\\partial_j$ は $x, y, z$ 方向の偏微分、同じ添字 $j$ が 2 回出たら $j = x, y, z$ で和を取ります。 $S_\\rho$ などはソース項（外力や加熱）で、ユーザーが与えます（12 節）。"
msgstr "MISO solves the ideal MHD equations in Gaussian units (the form in which the magnetic terms carry a factor $1/4\\pi$). $\\partial_j$ is the partial derivative in the $x, y, z$ directions, and when the same index $j$ appears twice, it is summed over $j = x, y, z$. $S_\\rho$ and the like are source terms (external forces and heating), which the user provides (Section 12)."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\rho}{\\partial t} &= -\\partial_j(\\rho v_j) + S_\\rho, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\partial (\\rho v_i)}{\\partial t} &= -\\partial_j(\\rho v_i v_j) - \\partial_i p\n"
"  - \\partial_i\\left(\\frac{B^2}{8\\pi}\\right) + \\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\partial_j(B_i B_j) + S_{v_i}, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\partial B_i}{\\partial t} &= \\partial_j(v_i B_j - v_j B_i) - \\partial_i \\phi + S_{B_i}, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\phi}{\\partial t} &= -c_h^2\\, \\partial_j B_j - \\frac{\\phi}{\\tau}, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\partial E}{\\partial t} &= -\\partial_j\\left[\\left(\\rho e + p + \\frac{1}{2}\\rho v^2 + \\frac{B^2}{4\\pi}\\right) v_j\n"
"  - \\frac{(\\boldsymbol{v}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B})}{4\\pi} B_j\\right] + S_E, \\\\\n"
"E &= \\rho e + \\frac{1}{2}\\rho v^2 + \\frac{B^2}{8\\pi}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "磁場の式の $-\\partial_i\\phi$ と $\\phi$ の式は、数値計算で生じる $\\nabla\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B}$ の誤差を波として運び出し（速さ $c_h$）、時間 $\\tau$ で減衰させる仕組みです。 この方法は双曲型の発散クリーニング（hyperbolic divergence cleaning）と呼ばれます（Dedner et al. 2002, J. Comput. Phys. 175, 645）。"
msgstr "The term $-\\partial_i\\phi$ in the magnetic field equation and the equation for $\\phi$ form a mechanism that carries the error of $\\nabla\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B}$ generated in the numerical calculation away as a wave (with speed $c_h$) and damps it over a time $\\tau$. This method is called hyperbolic divergence cleaning (Dedner et al. 2002, J. Comput. Phys. 175, 645)."

msgid "1.3 状態方程式"
msgstr "1.3 Equation of state"

msgid "圧力 $p$ と音速 $c_s$ は状態方程式（EOS: equation of state）から求めます。 MISO が用意している理想気体の EOS は `miso/include/miso/eos.hpp` の `eos::IdealEOS` です。比熱比を $\\gamma$（設定の `eos.gm`）として、"
msgstr "The pressure $p$ and the sound speed $c_s$ are obtained from the equation of state (EOS). The ideal-gas EOS that MISO provides is `eos::IdealEOS` in `miso/include/miso/eos.hpp`. With the ratio of specific heats $\\gamma$ (`eos.gm` in the configuration),"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"p = (\\gamma - 1)\\rho e, \\qquad c_s = \\sqrt{\\gamma(\\gamma - 1) e} = \\sqrt{\\gamma p/\\rho}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "を、`gas_pressure` と `sound_speed` の 2 つのメンバ関数で計算します。 どちらも `for_each` で全格子点を処理します（{ref}`第 7 章 <edu-ch07>`）。"
msgstr "are computed by the two member functions `gas_pressure` and `sound_speed`. Both process all grid points with `for_each` ({ref}`Chapter 7 <edu-ch07>`)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "メンバ変数 `gm` をローカル変数 `gm_` に写してからラムダで使うのは、{ref}`第 9 章 <edu-ch09>` で説明した `this` キャプチャを避けるためです。"
msgstr "The member variable `gm` is copied to the local variable `gm_` before being used in the lambda in order to avoid the `this` capture explained in {ref}`Chapter 9 <edu-ch09>`."

