msgstr "`impl_cuda::ArtificialViscosity` (`mhd_artificial_viscosity_cuda.cuh`)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "CPU 版の `update_sc4` は、`for_each` ではなく、ふつうの三重の `for` 文で書かれています。 `i` が外側、`k` が内側のループで、最後の添字が連続する `Array3D` の並び（{ref}`第 7 章 <edu-ch07>`）に沿ってメモリを読みます。"
msgstr "The CPU version of `update_sc4` is written with an ordinary triple `for` statement, not `for_each`. With `i` as the outer loop and `k` as the inner loop, it reads memory along the layout of `Array3D`, in which the last index is contiguous ({ref}`Chapter 7 <edu-ch07>`)."

msgid "6. CFL 条件による時間刻み"
msgstr "6\\. Time step from the CFL condition"

msgid "時間刻みは、どの格子点でも、最も速い波が 1 ステップで格子間隔を越えないように決めます。"
msgstr "The time step is chosen so that, at every grid point, the fastest wave does not cross the grid spacing in one step."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta t = C \\min_{i,j,k} \\frac{\\min(\\Delta x_i, \\Delta y_j, \\Delta z_k)}{c_s + |\\boldsymbol{v}| + c_A},\n"
"\\qquad c_A = \\frac{|\\boldsymbol{B}|}{\\sqrt{4\\pi\\rho}}\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "$C$ は設定の `mhd.cfl_number`、$c_A$ は Alfvén 速度です。"
msgstr "$C$ is `mhd.cfl_number` in the configuration, and $c_A$ is the Alfvén speed."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "ループの範囲は `i_margin` から `i_total - i_margin` の手前まで、つまりゴーストセルを除いた、このランクが受け持つ格子点です。 各ランクで最小値を求めたあと、`MPI_Allreduce` の `MPI_MIN` で全ランクの最小値をそろえます（{ref}`第 8 章 <edu-ch08>`）。 すべてのランクが同じ $\\Delta t$ で進まないと、隣と交換する値の時刻がずれるためです。"
msgstr "The loop runs from `i_margin` up to just before `i_total - i_margin`, that is, over the grid points this rank is responsible for, excluding ghost cells. After each rank finds its minimum, `MPI_MIN` in `MPI_Allreduce` makes the global minimum common to all ranks ({ref}`Chapter 8 <edu-ch08>`). This is because, unless all ranks advance with the same $\\Delta t$, the times of the values exchanged with neighbors would be inconsistent."

msgid "7. 4 段の Runge–Kutta 法"
msgstr "7\\. Four-stage Runge–Kutta method"

msgid "7.1 runge_kutta_4step"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "方程式を $\\partial q/\\partial t = R(q)$ と書きます。$q$ は保存量（$\\rho$, $\\rho\\boldsymbol{v}$, $\\boldsymbol{B}$, $\\phi$, $E$）、$R$ は右辺（空間微分とソース項）です。 MISO は、次の 4 段で $q^n$ から $q^{n+1}$ を作ります。"
msgstr "Write the equation as $\\partial q/\\partial t = R(q)$. $q$ is the conserved quantities ($\\rho$, $\\rho\\boldsymbol{v}$, $\\boldsymbol{B}$, $\\phi$, $E$), and $R$ is the right-hand side (spatial derivatives and source terms). MISO builds $q^{n+1}$ from $q^n$ in the following 4 stages."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"q^{(1)} &= q^n + \\frac{\\Delta t}{4} R(q^n), \\\\\n"
"q^{(2)} &= q^n + \\frac{\\Delta t}{3} R(q^{(1)}), \\\\\n"
"q^{(3)} &= q^n + \\frac{\\Delta t}{2} R(q^{(2)}), \\\\\n"
"q^{n+1} &= q^n + \\Delta t\\, R(q^{(3)}).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "各段は「元の値 $q^n$ に、直前の段の値で評価した右辺を足す」形です。必要な配列は、元の値、直前の段の値、結果の 3 組だけです。"
msgstr "Each stage has the form \"add the right-hand side, evaluated with the value from the previous stage, to the original value $q^n$.\" The only arrays needed are three sets: the original value, the value of the previous stage, and the result."

msgid "`update_sc4(段の dt, eos, src, 元の値, 右辺を評価する値, 結果)` の引数と、式の対応は次のとおりです。"
msgstr "The arguments of `update_sc4(stage dt, eos, src, original value, value for evaluating the right-hand side, result)` correspond to the formulas as follows."

msgid "引数"
msgstr "Argument"

msgid "配列"
msgstr "Array"

msgid "式の記号"
msgstr "Symbol in the formula"

msgid "`qq_orgn`（3 番目の `Fields`）"
msgstr "`qq_orgn` (the 3rd `Fields`)"

msgid "`qq`"
msgstr ""

msgid "$q^n$（ステップの最初の値。4 段の間は変えません）"
msgstr "$q^n$ (the value at the start of the step; unchanged during the 4 stages)"

msgid "`qq_argm`（4 番目）"
msgstr "`qq_argm` (the 4th)"

msgid "1 段目は `qq`、2 段目以降は `qq_argm`"
msgstr "`qq` for the 1st stage, `qq_argm` for the 2nd stage onward"

msgid "$R(\\cdot)$ に入れる直前の段の値"
msgstr "The value from the previous stage that is fed into $R(\\cdot)$"

msgid "`qq_rslt`（5 番目）"
msgstr "`qq_rslt` (the 5th)"

msgid "`qq_rslt`"
msgstr ""

msgid "その段の結果"
msgstr "The result of that stage"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "各段の結果は `qq_rslt` に書かれ、`copy_from` で `qq_argm` へ写してから境界条件を適用します。 `update_sc4` はゴーストセルを除いた格子点だけを更新するので、次の段の右辺を計算する前に、ゴーストセルを埋め直す必要があります。 {ref}`第 10 章 <edu-ch10>` の熱伝導で、時間積分の各段の前に境界の値を用意したのと同じ順序です。 最後の段だけは結果を `qq` に戻し、これが $q^{n+1}$ になります。"
msgstr "The result of each stage is written to `qq_rslt`, copied to `qq_argm` with `copy_from`, and then the boundary condition is applied. `update_sc4` updates only the grid points excluding the ghost cells, so the ghost cells must be refilled before the right-hand side of the next stage is computed. This is the same order as in the heat conduction calculation of {ref}`Chapter 10 <edu-ch10>`, where the boundary values were prepared before each stage of the time integration. Only in the last stage is the result put back into `qq`, and this becomes $q^{n+1}$."

msgid "7.2 段の係数を確かめる"
msgstr "7.2 Checking the stage coefficients"

msgid "線形の方程式 $dq/dt = \\lambda q$ では、$R(q) = \\lambda q$ なので、$h = \\lambda\\Delta t$ として順に代入すると"
msgstr "For the linear equation $dq/dt = \\lambda q$, we have $R(q) = \\lambda q$, so substituting in order with $h = \\lambda\\Delta t$ gives"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"q^{n+1} = \\left(1 + h + \\frac{h^2}{2} + \\frac{h^3}{6} + \\frac{h^4}{24}\\right) q^n\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "となり、厳密解 $e^{h} q^n$ の Taylor 展開と 4 次の項まで一致します。 次の短いプログラムは、$dq/dt = -q$ を同じ 4 段で $t = 1$ まで解き、厳密解 $e^{-1}$ との差を表示します。"
msgstr "which agrees with the Taylor expansion of the exact solution $e^{h} q^n$ up to the fourth-order term. The following short program solves $dq/dt = -q$ up to $t = 1$ with the same 4 stages and prints the difference from the exact solution $e^{-1}$."

msgid "ステップ数を 2 倍にすると誤差がおよそ $1/16 = 1/2^4$ になり、4 次精度であることが分かります。"
msgstr "Doubling the number of steps reduces the error to about $1/16 = 1/2^4$, which shows that the method is fourth-order accurate."

msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>コラム：この 4 段の方法と非線形の方程式</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Column: This four-stage method and nonlinear equations</summary>\n"

msgid "この形の多段法は、Jameson, Schmidt, Turkel (1981, AIAA Paper 81-1259) が圧縮性流体の計算に用いたことで知られています。 各段で保存する配列が少なくて済むのが利点です。"
msgstr "This form of multistage method is known from its use by Jameson, Schmidt, and Turkel (1981, AIAA Paper 81-1259) for compressible flow calculations. Its advantage is that few arrays need to be kept at each stage."

msgid "係数 $1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 1$ は、線形の方程式に対して 4 次精度になるように選ばれています。 非線形の方程式 $dq/dt = f(q)$ では、$\\Delta t^3$ の項のうち $f''f^2$ に掛かる係数を展開して比べると、この方法では $1/8$、厳密解では $1/6$ となり一致しません。 そのため、非線形の方程式に対する形式上の精度は 2 次です。 一方、線形の安定領域は古典的な 4 段 Runge–Kutta 法と同じです。 `miso/include/miso/mhd_resistivity.hpp` のコメントにある「RK4 の安定条件 $\\lambda\\Delta t < 2.78$」も、この安定領域から来ています。"
msgstr "The coefficients $1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 1$ are chosen so that the method is fourth-order accurate for linear equations. For a nonlinear equation $dq/dt = f(q)$, expanding and comparing the coefficient of $f''f^2$ in the $\\Delta t^3$ term gives $1/8$ for this method and $1/6$ for the exact solution, which do not agree. The formal accuracy for nonlinear equations is therefore second order. On the other hand, the linear stability region is the same as that of the classical four-stage Runge–Kutta method. The \"stability condition of RK4, $\\lambda\\Delta t < 2.78$\" in the comment of `miso/include/miso/mhd_resistivity.hpp` also comes from this stability region."

msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "8. 4 次中心差分と右辺の計算"
msgstr "8\\. Fourth-order central difference and the right-hand side"

msgid "8.1 space_centered_4th"
msgstr ""

msgid "空間微分は、4 次精度の中心差分で近似します。等間隔の格子で、"
msgstr "Spatial derivatives are approximated with a fourth-order central difference. On a uniformly spaced grid,"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\left.\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\right|_i \\approx\n"
"\\frac{-f_{i+2} + 8 f_{i+1} - 8 f_{i-1} + f_{i-2}}{12\\, \\Delta x}\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "です。誤差は $\\Delta x^4$ に比例します。片側に 2 点ずつ使うので、ゴーストセルの幅（`grid.margin`）は 2 以上必要です。"
msgstr "The error is proportional to $\\Delta x^4$. Because it uses 2 points on each side, the ghost cell width (`grid.margin`) must be at least 2."

msgid "微分する配列（`const` の View）"
msgstr "The array to differentiate (a `const` view)"

msgid "`dxyzi`"
msgstr ""

msgid "格子間隔の逆数 $1/\\Delta x$（`grid.dxi[i]` など）"
msgstr "The reciprocal of the grid spacing, $1/\\Delta x$ (`grid.dxi[i]` and so on)"

msgid "`i, j, k`"
msgstr ""

msgid "微分を求める格子点"
msgstr "The grid point at which the derivative is evaluated"

msgid "`is, js, ks`"
msgstr ""

msgid "微分の方向。$x$ 方向なら `(grid.is, 0, 0)`"
msgstr "The direction of differentiation. For the $x$ direction, `(grid.is, 0, 0)`"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "方向を `is, js, ks` で選ぶので、1 つの関数で 3 方向の微分を書けます。 `grid.is` は、$x$ 方向の格子数が 2 以上なら 1、1 なら 0 です。格子数が 1 の方向では添字がずれず、その方向の微分は 0 になります（練習 4）。 `inv12<Real>` は $1/12$ を `Real` 型で表す変数テンプレートです（`miso/include/miso/constants.hpp`、{ref}`第 6 章 <edu-ch06>`）。"
msgstr "Because the direction is selected with `is, js, ks`, one function can handle the derivatives in all 3 directions. `grid.is` is 1 if the number of grid points in the $x$ direction is 2 or more, and 0 if it is 1. In a direction with one grid point, the index does not shift, and the derivative in that direction becomes 0 (Exercise 4). `inv12<Real>` is a variable template that represents $1/12$ in type `Real` (`miso/include/miso/constants.hpp`, {ref}`Chapter 6 <edu-ch06>`)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "同じ名前で、2 つまたは 3 つの配列の積を微分する関数もあります（オーバーロード、{ref}`第 2 章 <edu-ch02>`）。 `space_centered_4th(c_ro, c_vx, dxi, ...)` は $\\partial_x(\\rho v_x)$、`space_centered_4th(c_ro, c_vx, c_vy, dyi, ...)` は $\\partial_y(\\rho v_x v_y)$ です。 各格子点で積を作ってから差分を取ります。"
msgstr "There are also functions with the same name that differentiate the product of two or three arrays (overloads, {ref}`Chapter 2 <edu-ch02>`). `space_centered_4th(c_ro, c_vx, dxi, ...)` computes $\\partial_x(\\rho v_x)$, and `space_centered_4th(c_ro, c_vx, c_vy, dyi, ...)` computes $\\partial_y(\\rho v_x v_y)$. The product is formed at each grid point before the difference is taken."

msgid "8.2 update_sc4 の準備"
msgstr "8.2 Preparation in update_sc4"

msgid "`update_sc4` は、最初に右辺で何度も使う量を配列に用意します。"
msgstr "`update_sc4` first prepares in arrays the quantities that are used many times on the right-hand side."

msgid "式"
msgstr "Formula"

msgid "使う場所"
msgstr "Where it is used"

msgid "`pr`"
msgstr ""

msgid "$p = (\\gamma-1)\\rho e$"
msgstr ""

msgid "運動方程式の圧力勾配"
msgstr "Pressure gradient in the equation of motion"

msgid "`bb`"
msgstr ""

msgid "$B^2$"
msgstr ""

msgid "運動方程式の磁気圧 $B^2/8\\pi$"
msgstr "Magnetic pressure $B^2/8\\pi$ in the equation of motion"

msgid "`ht`"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\rho e + p + \\frac{1}{2}\\rho v^2 + \\frac{B^2}{4\\pi}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "エネルギーの流束"
msgstr "Energy flux"

msgid "`vb`"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\boldsymbol{v}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "差分を取るので、ゴーストセルを含む全格子点で計算します。どれも `qq_argm`（右辺を評価する値）から作ります。"
msgstr "Because differences are taken, these are computed at all grid points including ghost cells. All of them are made from `qq_argm` (the value used to evaluate the right-hand side)."

msgid "続いて、`const_view()` で読み取り専用の View を作り、名前を短くしています（`c_ro`, `c_vx`, ... `c_ph`）。"
msgstr "Next, read-only views are created with `const_view()` and given short names (`c_ro`, `c_vx`, ... `c_ph`)."

msgid "8.3 方程式とコードの対応"
msgstr "8.3 Correspondence between the equations and the code"

msgid "2 つ目の三重ループで、ゴーストセルを除いた格子点を更新します。 段の時間刻みを $\\Delta t'$（`dt` 引数。$\\Delta t/4$ など）、`space_centered_4th` を $D_x, D_y, D_z$ と書きます。"
msgstr "The second triple loop updates the grid points excluding the ghost cells. We write the time step of a stage as $\\Delta t'$ (the `dt` argument; for example $\\Delta t/4$) and `space_centered_4th` as $D_x, D_y, D_z$."

msgid "**連続の式**"
msgstr "**Continuity equation**"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\rho^{\\text{rslt}} = \\rho^{n} + \\Delta t' \\left[ -D_x(\\rho v_x) - D_y(\\rho v_y) - D_z(\\rho v_z) + S_\\rho \\right]\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "右辺の $\\rho v_x$ などは `qq_argm` の値、左辺に足す $\\rho^n$ は `qq_orgn` の値です。7 節の式の形と一致します。"
msgstr "The $\\rho v_x$ and so on on the right-hand side are values from `qq_argm`, and the $\\rho^n$ added to it is the value from `qq_orgn`. This matches the form of the formula in Section 7."

msgid "**運動方程式（$x$ 成分）**"
msgstr "**Equation of motion ($x$ component)**"

msgid ""
"\n"
"v_x^{\\text{rslt}} = \\frac{1}{\\rho^{\\text{rslt}}}\\left\\{ \\rho^n v_x^n + \\Delta t' \\left[\n"
"-D_j(\\rho v_x v_j) - D_x p - \\frac{1}{8\\pi} D_x(B^2) + \\frac{1}{4\\pi} D_j(B_x B_j) + S_{v_x}\n"
"\\right]\\right\\}\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "保存量 $\\rho v_x$ を進めてから、新しい密度 $\\rho^{\\text{rslt}}$ で割って速度に戻しています。 そのため、連続の式（`qq_rslt.ro`）を先に計算しておく必要があります。 `pii4<Real>` と `pii8<Real>` は $1/4\\pi$ と $1/8\\pi$ です（`miso/include/miso/constants.hpp`）。$y, z$ 成分も同じ形です。"
msgstr "The conserved quantity $\\rho v_x$ is advanced and then divided by the new density $\\rho^{\\text{rslt}}$ to recover the velocity. For this reason, the continuity equation (`qq_rslt.ro`) must be computed first. `pii4<Real>` and `pii8<Real>` are $1/4\\pi$ and $1/8\\pi$ (`miso/include/miso/constants.hpp`). The $y, z$ components have the same form."

msgid "**誘導方程式（$x$ 成分）**"
msgstr "**Induction equation ($x$ component)**"

msgid ""
"\n"
"B_x^{\\text{rslt}} = B_x^n + \\Delta t' \\left[ D_y(v_x B_y - v_y B_x) + D_z(v_x B_z - v_z B_x) - D_x\\phi + S_{B_x} \\right]\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "1.2 節の誘導方程式で $i = x$ とした式です（$j = x$ の項は $v_x B_x - v_x B_x = 0$ なので書いていません）。最後の $-D_x\\phi$ が発散クリーニングの項です。"
msgstr "This is the induction equation of Section 1.2 with $i = x$ (the $j = x$ term is not written because $v_x B_x - v_x B_x = 0$). The last term, $-D_x\\phi$, is the divergence-cleaning term."

msgid "**発散クリーニングの $\\phi$**"
msgstr "**The divergence-cleaning $\\phi$**"

msgid "`qq_rslt.ph` の式は、`ch_divb_square`（$c_h^2$）と `util::exp(-dt/tau_divb)` を使って次の形になっています。"
msgstr "The formula for `qq_rslt.ph` takes the following form, using `ch_divb_square` ($c_h^2$) and `util::exp(-dt/tau_divb)`."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\phi^{\\text{rslt}} = \\left[ \\phi^n - \\Delta t'\\, c_h^2 \\left( D_x B_x + D_y B_y + D_z B_z \\right) \\right] e^{-\\Delta t'/\\tau}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$-c_h^2\\nabla\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B}$ の項を差分で進め、減衰の項 $-\\phi/\\tau$ は、厳密解の因子 $e^{-\\Delta t'/\\tau}$ を掛けて扱っています。"
msgstr "The term $-c_h^2\\nabla\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B}$ is advanced with the finite difference, and the damping term $-\\phi/\\tau$ is handled by multiplying by the exact-solution factor $e^{-\\Delta t'/\\tau}$."

msgid "**エネルギーの式**"
msgstr "**Energy equation**"

msgid ""
"\n"
"e^{\\text{rslt}} = \\frac{1}{\\rho^{\\text{rslt}}}\\left\\{\n"
"E^n + \\Delta t' \\left[ -D_j(h_t v_j) + \\frac{1}{4\\pi} D_j\\big((\\boldsymbol{v}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{B}) B_j\\big) + S_E \\right]\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2}\\rho^{\\text{rslt}} (v^{\\text{rslt}})^2 - \\frac{(B^{\\text{rslt}})^2}{8\\pi}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "全エネルギー $E$ を進め、同じ段で求めた新しい $\\rho$, $\\boldsymbol{v}$, $\\boldsymbol{B}$ の運動エネルギーと磁気エネルギーを引いて、内部エネルギーに戻します。 新しい速度と磁場を使うので、エネルギーの式はループの最後に置かれています。 ソース項 `source_ei` は、全エネルギーの式の右辺 $S_E$（単位体積・単位時間あたり）です。"
msgstr "The total energy $E$ is advanced, and the kinetic and magnetic energies of the new $\\rho$, $\\boldsymbol{v}$, and $\\boldsymbol{B}$ computed in the same stage are subtracted to recover the internal energy. Because it uses the new velocity and magnetic field, the energy equation is placed at the end of the loop. The source term `source_ei` is the right-hand side $S_E$ of the total energy equation (per unit volume and unit time)."

msgid "8.4 ソース項の取り出し"
msgstr "8.4 Extracting the source terms"

msgid "`source_ro(src, c_qq, i, j, k)` などは、`miso/include/miso/mhd_integrator.hpp` のマクロ `MISO_MHD_DEFINE_SOURCE_TERM` が作る関数です。"
msgstr "`source_ro(src, c_qq, i, j, k)` and the like are functions generated by the macro `MISO_MHD_DEFINE_SOURCE_TERM` in `miso/include/miso/mhd_integrator.hpp`."

msgid "次は、マクロが `vy` について作る関数の本体を、マクロの引数 `name` を `vy` に置き換えて示したものです（説明のために展開しました）。"
msgstr "The following shows the body of the function that the macro generates for `vy`, with the macro argument `name` replaced by `vy` (expanded for explanation)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "ソース項の型 `Source` が、たとえば `vy(FieldsView<const Real>, int, int, int) const` というメンバ関数を持っていればそれを呼び、持っていなければ 0 を返します（{ref}`第 6 章 <edu-ch06>`）。 `mhd::EmptySourceTerm` は何も持たないので、8 つのソース項がすべて 0 になります。 判定はコンパイル時に行われるので、定義していない項のために計算が増えることはありません。 ソース項は、右辺を評価する値 `c_qq`（`qq_argm`）で各段ごとに呼ばれます。"
msgstr "If the source term type `Source` has a member function such as `vy(FieldsView<const Real>, int, int, int) const`, it is called; if not, 0 is returned ({ref}`Chapter 6 <edu-ch06>`). `mhd::EmptySourceTerm` has nothing, so all 8 source terms are 0. The decision is made at compile time, so terms that are not defined add no computation. The source terms are called at each stage with `c_qq` (`qq_argm`), the value used to evaluate the right-hand side."

msgid "9. 境界条件とハロー交換"
msgstr "9\\. Boundary conditions and halo exchange"

msgid "9.1 apply_boundary_condition"
msgstr ""

msgid "RK4 の各段と人工粘性の各方向のあとで、次の関数が呼ばれます。"
msgstr "The following function is called after each stage of RK4 and after each direction of the artificial viscosity."

msgid "`bc.apply` で、ユーザーが与えた物理境界条件を適用します。"
msgstr "Apply the physical boundary condition given by the user with `bc.apply`."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "`halo_exchanger.apply` で、隣のランクとゴーストセルの値を交換します（ハロー交換、{ref}`第 8 章 <edu-ch08>`）。"
msgstr "Exchange ghost cell values with the neighboring ranks with `halo_exchanger.apply` (halo exchange, {ref}`Chapter 8 <edu-ch08>`)."

msgid "`bc.apply` の引数の形は、`Model` の `bc` が必ず持つ約束です。"
msgstr "The argument form of `bc.apply` is a convention that the `bc` of `Model` must follow."

msgid "9.2 ハロー交換と周期境界"
msgstr "9.2 Halo exchange and periodic boundaries"

msgid "ハロー交換は `miso/include/miso/mhd_halo_exchange.hpp` の `HaloExchanger` にあります。 CPU 版の `apply` は、$x$ → $y$ → $z$ の順に、方向ごとに次を行います。"
msgstr "Halo exchange is in `HaloExchanger` in `miso/include/miso/mhd_halo_exchange.hpp`. The CPU version of `apply` does the following for each direction, in the order $x$ → $y$ → $z$."

msgid "9 変数のうち送る範囲（端から `margin` 枚）を送信用の `Array4D` に詰めます。"
msgstr "Pack the range to send (`margin` layers from the edge) of the 9 variables into a send `Array4D`."

msgid "`MPI_Isend` と `MPI_Irecv` で正の側と負の側に同時に送受信し、`MPI_Waitall` で待ちます。"
msgstr "Send and receive on the positive and negative sides at the same time with `MPI_Isend` and `MPI_Irecv`, and wait with `MPI_Waitall`."

msgid "受け取った値をゴーストセルへ書き込みます。"
msgstr "Write the received values into the ghost cells."

msgid "方向を 1 つずつ交換するので、$y$ 方向で送る範囲には、直前に $x$ 方向で受け取ったゴーストセルも含まれます。 そのため、角のゴーストセルにも正しい値が入ります。"
msgstr "Because the directions are exchanged one at a time, the range sent in the $y$ direction includes the ghost cells received just before in the $x$ direction. As a result, the corner ghost cells also receive correct values."

msgid "隣のランクは、`mpi::Shape` が `MPI_Cart_shift` で求めた `x_procs_pos` などです。 `domain.periodic` で周期境界にした方向では、領域の端のランクの隣が反対側の端のランクになります。 その方向のプロセス数が 1 なら、隣は自分自身です。 つまり、**周期境界はハロー交換が担います**。全方向が周期境界の問題では、`bc` に何もしない `mhd::EmptyBoundaryCondition` を使えます。"
msgstr "The neighboring ranks are `x_procs_pos` and the like, which `mpi::Shape` obtains with `MPI_Cart_shift`. In a direction made periodic with `domain.periodic`, the neighbor of the rank at one end of the domain is the rank at the opposite end. If the number of processes in that direction is 1, the neighbor is the rank itself. In other words, **the halo exchange takes care of the periodic boundary**. For a problem in which all directions are periodic, you can use `mhd::EmptyBoundaryCondition`, which does nothing, as `bc`."

msgid "周期境界にしない方向の端では、隣が `MPI_PROC_NULL` になり、交換は行われません。そのゴーストセルを埋めるのが `bc.apply` の役目です。"
msgstr "At the end of a direction that is not periodic, the neighbor is `MPI_PROC_NULL` and no exchange takes place. Filling those ghost cells is the role of `bc.apply`."

msgid "9.3 物理境界の例"
msgstr "9.3 Example of a physical boundary"

msgid "`demo/hd2d_rayleigh_taylor/src/main.cpp` の `BoundaryCondition` は、$y$ 方向の両端に対称境界を置きます。"
msgstr "The `BoundaryCondition` in `demo/hd2d_rayleigh_taylor/src/main.cpp` places symmetric boundaries at both ends in the $y$ direction."

msgid "`is_physical_boundary`（`miso/include/miso/boundary_condition.hpp`）は、このランクの $y$ 方向の負の側（`Side::INNER`）に隣のランクがない、つまり領域の端を受け持っているかを調べます。 MPI で分割していると、端を受け持たないランクもあるので、この判定が必要です。"
msgstr "`is_physical_boundary` (`miso/include/miso/boundary_condition.hpp`) checks whether this rank has no neighboring rank on the negative side in the $y$ direction (`Side::INNER`), that is, whether it is responsible for the edge of the domain. When the domain is decomposed with MPI, some ranks are not responsible for an edge, so this check is necessary."

msgid "`symmetric` は、境界をはさんで鏡に映した位置の値をゴーストセルに写します。`Sign::Neg` なら符号を反転します。 境界に垂直な速度 `vy` だけを反転させ、境界を通り抜ける流れを 0 にしています。"
msgstr "`symmetric` copies the value at the mirror-image position across the boundary into the ghost cell. With `Sign::Neg`, the sign is reversed. Only the velocity `vy` perpendicular to the boundary is reversed, which makes the flow through the boundary 0."

msgid "10. 人工粘性"
msgstr "10\\. Artificial viscosity"

msgid "中心差分だけでは、衝撃波などの急な変化の近くで数値振動が生じます。 MISO は、RK4 のあとに人工粘性（人工拡散）を 1 回かけて、急な変化の近くだけを選んでならします。 実装は `miso/include/miso/mhd_artificial_viscosity_host.hpp` の `impl_host::ArtificialViscosity` で、方法は Rempel (2014, ApJ 789, 132) に基づきます（`config_defaults.hpp` のコメント）。"
msgstr "With the central difference alone, numerical oscillations occur near sharp changes such as shock waves. After RK4, MISO applies artificial viscosity (artificial diffusion) once, selectively smoothing only the neighborhood of sharp changes. The implementation is `impl_host::ArtificialViscosity` in `miso/include/miso/mhd_artificial_viscosity_host.hpp`, and the method is based on Rempel (2014, ApJ 789, 132) (see the comment in `config_defaults.hpp`)."

msgid "10.1 方向ごとの更新"
msgstr "10.1 Update in each direction"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "最初に特性速度 $c = f_{cs} c_s + f_{vv}|\\boldsymbol{v}| + f_{ca} c_A$ を全格子点で求めます（係数は設定の `mhd.artificial_viscosity.cs_fac` など）。 そのあと $x, y, z$ の順に 1 方向ずつ更新し、そのたびに境界条件とハロー交換を行います。"
msgstr "First, compute the characteristic speed $c = f_{cs} c_s + f_{vv}|\\boldsymbol{v}| + f_{ca} c_A$ at all grid points (the coefficients are `mhd.artificial_viscosity.cs_fac` and so on in the configuration). Then update one direction at a time in the order $x, y, z$, applying the boundary condition and halo exchange each time."

msgid "10.2 拡散流束"
msgstr "10.2 Diffusive flux"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "1 方向の更新は、セル境界 $i+1/2$ での流束 $F_{i+1/2}$ の差です。"
msgstr "The update in one direction is the difference of the fluxes $F_{i+1/2}$ at the cell boundaries $i+1/2$."

msgid ""
"\n"
"q_i^{\\text{new}} = q_i - \\frac{\\Delta t}{\\Delta x}\\left(F_{i+1/2} - F_{i-1/2}\\right)\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "対象は $\\rho$, $\\rho\\boldsymbol{v}$, $\\boldsymbol{B}$, $\\phi$, $\\rho e$ です。流束は `miso/include/miso/limiter.hpp` の 2 つの関数で作ります。"
msgstr "The targets are $\\rho$, $\\rho\\boldsymbol{v}$, $\\boldsymbol{B}$, $\\phi$, and $\\rho e$. The flux is built by two functions in `miso/include/miso/limiter.hpp`."

msgid "関数"
msgstr "Function"

msgid "計算"
msgstr "Computation"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "`dqq_eval(q_{i-1}, q_i, q_{i+1}, ep)`"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "傾き $\\Delta q_i$。$\\varepsilon(q_i - q_{i-1})$、$\\varepsilon(q_{i+1} - q_i)$、$(q_{i+1} - q_{i-1})/2$ の符号がそろっていれば絶対値が最小のもの、そろっていなければ 0（一般化 minmod 制限子）。$\\varepsilon$ は設定の `ep`"
msgstr "The slope $\\Delta q_i$. If $\\varepsilon(q_i - q_{i-1})$, $\\varepsilon(q_{i+1} - q_i)$, and $(q_{i+1} - q_{i-1})/2$ have the same sign, it is the one with the smallest absolute value; otherwise it is 0 (generalized minmod limiter). $\\varepsilon$ is `ep` in the configuration"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "`flux_core(q_i, q_{i+1}, Δq_i, Δq_{i+1}, c, fh)`"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "セル境界の左右の値 $q_L = q_i + \\Delta q_i/2$, $q_R = q_{i+1} - \\Delta q_{i+1}/2$ を作り、$F = -\\frac{1}{2} c\\, \\Phi\\, (q_R - q_L)$ を返す"
msgstr "Builds the values on the left and right of the cell boundary, $q_L = q_i + \\Delta q_i/2$ and $q_R = q_{i+1} - \\Delta q_{i+1}/2$, and returns $F = -\\frac{1}{2} c\\, \\Phi\\, (q_R - q_L)$"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\Phi$ は、$r = \\min\\left(1, (q_R - q_L)/(q_{i+1} - q_i)\\right)$ を使って、$r \\ge 0$ なら $\\max(0, 1 + h(r - 1))$、$r < 0$ なら 0 です。$h$ は設定の `fh` です。 変化がなめらかなところでは $q_R \\approx q_L$ なので流束はほぼ 0 です。急な変化があって $q_R - q_L$ が大きく残るところだけで拡散が働きます。"
msgstr "$\\Phi$ is defined using $r = \\min\\left(1, (q_R - q_L)/(q_{i+1} - q_i)\\right)$: it is $\\max(0, 1 + h(r - 1))$ if $r \\ge 0$ and 0 if $r < 0$. $h$ is `fh` in the configuration. Where the variation is smooth, $q_R \\approx q_L$, so the flux is almost 0. Diffusion acts only where there is a sharp change and $q_R - q_L$ remains large."

msgid "エネルギーは、$\\rho e$ の流束で全エネルギーを更新したあと、新しい運動エネルギーと磁気エネルギーを引いて内部エネルギーに戻します。 人工粘性で失われた運動エネルギーと磁気エネルギーは、内部エネルギーに移ります。"
msgstr "For the energy, the total energy is updated with the flux of $\\rho e$, and then the new kinetic and magnetic energies are subtracted to recover the internal energy. The kinetic and magnetic energy lost to artificial viscosity is transferred to the internal energy."

msgid "11. 出力と再開"
msgstr "11\\. Output and restart"

msgid "11.1 出力の時刻"
msgstr "11.1 Output times"

msgid "時刻が `dt_output * n_output` 以上になった最初のステップで出力します。時間刻みを出力時刻に合わせて調整しないので、出力時刻はちょうど `dt_output` の倍数にはなりません（練習 6）。 `time.log()` は、ランク 0 で次のような行を表示します（`demo/mhd2d_vortex` を `tend: 0.03` にして 2 プロセスで実行した例）。"
msgstr "Output is written at the first step at which the time reaches `dt_output * n_output` or more. The time step is not adjusted to match the output time, so the output time is not exactly a multiple of `dt_output` (Exercise 6). `time.log()` prints lines like the following on rank 0 (an example running `demo/mhd2d_vortex` with `tend: 0.03` on 2 processes)."

msgid "11.2 出力されるファイル"
msgstr "11.2 Files that are written"

msgid "すべて `io.save_dir`（既定は設定ファイルと同じフォルダの `data/`）の下に書かれます。"
msgstr "All of them are written under `io.save_dir` (by default, `data/` in the same folder as the configuration file)."

